hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath [surah] Izas Samaunshaqqat [Al-Inshiqaq] mein sajda kiya.'"
"29","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo apna saman — ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] — kisi aise shakhs ke paas paye jo dewaliya ho gaya ho to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"30","[AI-translation] Ibnul Madini ne hamen bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamen bayan kiya, Amr bin Dinar se, Hisham bin Yahya se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"31","[AI-translation] Ibnul Madini ne hamen bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamen bayan kiya, Amr bin Dinar se, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"32","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ansari ne hamen bayan kiya, Anas bin Iyaz ne hamen bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs dewaliya ho jaye phir koi shakhs apna maal ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] us ke paas paye to wo gairon se zyada us ka haqdar hai.'"
"34","[AI-translation] Ahmad bin Abdullah ne hamen bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hamen bayan kiya, Malik se, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — aur unhon ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ka zikr nahin kiya."
"35","[AI-translation] Abu Tahir ne hamen bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Wahb ne hamen bayan kiya, Malik ne mujhe khabar di, Yahya se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"36","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs dewaliya ho jaye phir koi shakhs apna saman ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] us ke paas paye to wo gairon se zyada us ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"37","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab koi shakhs dewaliya ho jaye phir koi shakhs apna tijarti saman ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"38","[AI-translation] Bayan Hadrami ne hamen bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamen bayan kiya, Amr bin Dinar se, Hisham bin Yahya se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"39","[AI-translation] Bayan Hadrami ne hamen bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamen bayan kiya, Amr se, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"40","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ansari ne hamen bayan kiya, Anas bin Iyaz ne hamen bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs dewaliya ho jaye, phir koi shakhs apna maal us ke paas paye to wo gairon se zyada us ka haqdar hai.'"
"42","[AI-translation] Ahmad bin Abdullah ne hamen bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hamen bayan kiya, Malik bin Anas se, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — aur unhon ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz ka zikr nahin kiya."
"43","[AI-translation] Abu Tahir ne hamen bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hamen bayan kiya, Malik ne mujhe khabar di, Yahya se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo apne maal ko ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] kisi aise shakhs ke hath mein paye jo dewaliya ho gaya ho to wo qarz khwahon mein se gairon se zyada us ka haqdar hai.'"
"45","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Ammar Mausili ne hamen bayan kiya, Zaid bin Abu Zarqa ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan (Rahimahullah) se ek shakhs ke bare mein poocha gaya jis ne tijarti saman khareeda, phir [khareedar] dewaliya ho gaya jabke saman ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] hai aur us ne us ki qeemat ada nahin ki, ya us ne qeemat ka kuch hissa ada kiya: kya [bechne wala] apna saman le sakta hai? To unhon ne Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se [hadees] bayan ki, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis ne tijarti saman khareeda phir us ka malik dewaliya ho gaya phir wo use paye to wo qarz khwahon ke muqable mein us ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"46","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs apna tijarti saman kisi aise shakhs ke paas paye jo dewaliya ho gaya ho to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"47","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs apna tijarti saman ba-ainihi [bila kami wa kast maujood] kisi aise shakhs ke paas paye jo dewaliya ho gaya ho to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"48","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Abdul Hakam ne hamen bayan kiya, mere walid ne hamen bayan kiya, Bakr bin Mudar ne hamen bayan kiya, Ibnul Had se, Abu Bakr bin Muhammad se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
"49","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: 'Beshak Allah ne is muamle [deen wa duniya ki islah] ki ibtida nabuwwat aur rehmat se ki, phir khilafat hogi, phir saltanat hogi, aur badshahat hogi, phir jabri [hukumat] hogi, phir [khairat wa izzat] hogi.'"
